sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente (navegador)
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant A as Auth Service
    participant O as orders
    participant K as clients
    participant I as inventory
    participant P as payments
    participant X as Proveedor de pagos
    C->>G: POST /orders (cookie HttpOnly)
    G->>A: introspect(token) [secreto arista gw->auth]
    A-->>G: identidad verificada (user, roles, client_id)
    G->>O: POST /orders + identidad [secreto arista gw->orders]
    O->>K: GET /clients/{client_id} [secreto orders->clients]
    K-->>O: 200 cliente existe
    O->>I: POST /reservations [secreto orders->inventory]
    I-->>O: 200 lineas con precio del catalogo, o 409 sin stock
    O-->>G: 201 pedido pendiente_pago (total calculado)
    G-->>C: 201
    C->>G: POST /payments + Idempotency-Key
    G->>P: POST /payments + identidad
    P->>O: GET /internal/orders/{id} [secreto payments->orders]
    O-->>P: cliente, total, estado
    P-->>C: 201 pago pending + refProveedor
    X->>G: POST /payments/webhook (firma HMAC)
    G->>P: reenvia cuerpo sin modificar
    P->>P: verifica HMAC (secreto en Vault) y event_id unico
    P->>O: POST /internal/orders/{id}/paid
    O-->>P: 200 pagado (o 409 si expiro)
    P-->>X: 200 processed / duplicate
